{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11109070","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11109070","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1110907001:0":{"text":"Here we are! This must be the notice board Atalanta and the peddler mentioned.","source_cn":"找到了，这就是阿塔兰忒和商贩小姐说的告示板吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE08A07A27050BF79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110907002:0":{"text":"Let me see...","source_cn":"让我来看看……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7464BA4C214102C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110907003:0":{"text":"\"Terrabird Hunt,\" \"Top secret about the treasure!\" \"Missing Person,\" \"Missing Person,\" \"Missing Person\"...","source_cn":"“陆行鸟狩猎”、“绝密！宝藏情报！”“寻人启事”、“寻...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x655B2DEA34648E08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1110907003":{"text":"\"Terrabird Hunt,\" \"Top secret about the treasure!\" \"Missing Person,\" \"Missing Person,\" \"Missing Person\"...","source_cn":"“陆行鸟狩猎”、“绝密！宝藏情报！”“寻人启事”、“寻人启事”、“寻人启事”……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x655B2DEA34648E08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110907004:0":{"text":"Soren, could you draw the missing kids?","source_cn":"唔，索恩，你能把失踪孩子的样貌画下来吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86887C25D22F85E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110907005:0":{"text":"A good sketch will help people recognize them!","source_cn":"有详细的样貌可以比对，应该更容易让见过他们的人认出来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBDA834DA95BCA62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110907006:0":{"text":"Soren, come on. Only you know what the missing kids look like!","source_cn":"索恩，靠你了！只有你知道失踪的孩子长什么样子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x671313BA7A2058E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110907007:0":{"text":"No problem. I'm the best artist in the Uru Clan.","source_cn":"交给我。我在乌尔氏族里最会画画。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x478579407B6BC870","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:11:1110907008:0":{"text":"Soren focuses intensely on the drawing...","source_cn":"一番涂抹后……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x746492AE5FD4E762","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110907009:0":{"text":"Done.","source_cn":"好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x113B5F69468C1410","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:13::0":{"text":"Soren's \"Missing Person\" Drawing","source_cn":"索恩《寻人启事》画像","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72A65B3951B5A1E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110907010:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"…………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70646B5D874C111A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110907011:0":{"text":"Er... It sure looks like... some kind of creature!","source_cn":"……这、这真是……能看出是一些生物呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD78EE690EEC73FE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110907012:0":{"text":"Seriously, can this sketch help us find the kids?","source_cn":"对照这个画像，真能找到人吗……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x280D31ABFB7D4C66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110907013:0":{"text":"I'm going for the spirit, not the looks. Pops told me a good portrait captures the spirit.","source_cn":"神似，而非形似。老爹说，这才是画像的精髓。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB327F3754F71DF9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110907014:0":{"text":"How are people supposed to recognize the kids by their spirits?","source_cn":"光凭神态要怎么找人啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B93D239743800B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1110907015:1":{"text":"Put it up. You never know, we might get super lucky.","source_cn":"先、先贴上吧，或许好运眷顾，真就有人见过长得这么抽象的人呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD34C3A6B26E7BE18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1110907016:0":{"text":"Ah, Soren, please don't take it the wrong way... After all, you are the greatest artist in the Uru Clan!","source_cn":"啊，索恩，我不是在说你画的不好……毕竟你是乌尔氏族最会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B2F7A082504EAF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:0:1":{"text":"A lot of people are missing...","source_cn":"看来失踪的人的确很多","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB2CA750FE09E79FE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"A lot of people are missing...","female":"A lot of people are missing...","variant_male_record_index":"63988","variant_female_record_index":"63989","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:5:1:2":{"text":"Let's post another notice.","source_cn":"要再加一张寻人启事了","status":"matc